Z||000009||ChadMan||06-01-2001||12:24 PM||||I had that Cake CD, but in a moment of poverty and stupidity, I sold it.<P>Does anyone remember MTV - Liquid Television?  (Yeah, I know, non-music programming on MTV sucks, but bear with me...)  Does anybody remember the cartoon they had about the racers -- and one guy, thinking about his lost love and his past glories, didn't stop driving after the race was over...he kept driving until his car disintegrated and killed him?  I always wondered if the guys from Cake saw that - the song is so similar to the cartoon.<P>If I saw that show now, as a sober 30-year-old, maybe it wouldn't seem so cool.  But as a baked college student, it was incredible.||||reg||3
